As a Visual Designer, you will be responsible for Methodic’s brand identity and visual communications. From marketing materials to our website graphics—and even the aesthetic aspects of our product—you will ensure that everything we present to the world is consistent, professional, and engaging. You'll work closely with marketing, sales, and product teams to create visuals that explain our value proposition and resonate with our target audience of fintech innovators.

