- ]:w-full [&amp;&gt;.sr-only]:w-auto"&gt;

Design marketing and sales collateral such as website banners, social media graphics, presentation decks, infographics, one-pagers, and case study PDFs that effectively communicate the benefits of our platform.



- ]:w-full [&amp;&gt;.sr-only]:w-auto"&gt;

Create visual assets for blog posts, webinars, and other content marketing efforts—e.g., diagrams that illustrate how Methodic works or icons that represent different features.



- ]:w-full [&amp;&gt;.sr-only]:w-auto"&gt;

Assist the product/design team by contributing graphic elements or illustrations for the web application and white-label app templates (ensuring they look clean and modern).



- ]:w-full [&amp;&gt;.sr-only]:w-auto"&gt;

Work with external vendors or printers if needed for physical materials (event booths, swag, printed brochures), making sure specifications are correct and quality is high.



- ]:w-full [&amp;&gt;.sr-only]:w-auto"&gt;

Stay current on design trends, especially in tech/fintech, to keep Methodic’s visuals fresh and appealing; proactively suggest new ideas for visual storytelling.



- ]:w-full [&amp;&gt;.sr-only]:w-auto"&gt;

Manage multiple design requests and projects, prioritizing based on business needs, and iterate quickly based on feedback from stakeholders.

