2.Participate in campaign ideation and execution, ensuring strong and consistent brand visual identity;


3.Localize visual content based on cultural context across different regions to enhance engagement and effectiveness;


4.Collaborate closely with brand, marketing, PR, and local teams to support product launches, seasonal campaigns, and brand collaborations;


